{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1211015001:1":{"text":"ふぅ……だいぶ苦労したが、なんとか三種類釣れたな！","source_cn":"累死了……费了这么大劲，总算钓齐了三种鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC57FE72D7EC1345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1211015002:1":{"text":"空も真っ暗だ。魚はいったん潮だまりで泳がしておこう。","source_cn":"天都黑了，先放在水洼里养着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D1A3A4D95CBCDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211015003:1":{"text":"次はこのお魚さんたちを、どこに持っていけばいいんでしょう？","source_cn":"接下来，我们要把这些鱼送去哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B4A39B13FE6AAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211015004:1":{"text":"あの喋れるグブリンは姫に捧げるって言ってたな。明るくなったらまた聞いてみようぜ。","source_cn":"那个智慧过人的咕布林说要送给公主，等天亮了再去找找吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3C4831F6D7278D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211015005:1":{"text":"お姫様の物語なら知ってるよ！勇敢な騎士様がお姫様を見つけて、夢の世界から連れ出すお話！","source_cn":"我听过公主的故事！勇敢的骑士找到了公主，把她从梦境里唤醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE720D262F76681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211015006:1":{"text":"そして……お姫様が刀で悪いドラゴンをやっつけちゃうの！","source_cn":"然后——公主拿起刀，把恶龙打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A769C4443BC2907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211015007:1":{"text":"ええ？そんなおとぎ話、聞いたことがありませんよ……","source_cn":"咦，这是什么童话故事？没听说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE09C8B9C987E08D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211015008:1":{"text":"ソニアお姉ちゃんが寝る前に話してくれたもん！","source_cn":"是索尼娅姐姐给我讲的睡前故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E68843D3E8F2EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211015009:1":{"text":"ごほんっ……適当に作った話だ。","source_cn":"咳……我随口编的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8963F7BCC9B81F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211015010:1":{"text":"ナーラ、お姉ちゃんが聞かせてくれる物語が大好きなの！お花の精霊がサメを食べちゃうお話とか、木こりが斧でギャングを倒すお話とか！","source_cn":"我很喜欢听索尼娅姐姐讲故事！无论是草仙子吃掉鲨鱼……还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DB2605241A5231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211015011:1":{"text":"ソニアさん……妹にどんな話を聞かせてんだ？あんた、思ったよりだいぶ面白い人だな！","source_cn":"索尼娅，你给你妹妹讲的都是些什么故事啊……嘿，你比我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2A4B833DCF598B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211015012:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーに入る前のことだ。自分ですら忘れていたのに、この子はまだ覚えていたとは……","source_cn":"那都是加入血薇帮很久以前的事了，我都记不清，她居然还记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EE338CE30402F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211015013:1":{"text":"お喋りはここまでだ。ここで夜を越すなら、まずは火を起こさないと。","source_cn":"不说这些了，如果要在这里过夜，我们得先把篝火燃起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA358CD7B233FA297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211015014:1":{"text":"手伝うぜ。","source_cn":"我来帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1EFD0CA0A695EA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211015015:1":{"text":"ロンロンも手伝います！","source_cn":"我也来帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8B3E3F70D9C64E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"sp